t}</style><style>.c3-aerial .c3ph-hero,.c3-aerial-close .c3ph-hero{max-width:760px}</style><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Pick a typical condo, or a town and a size, and put in the listing's own price and HOA fee. The calculator fills in what Airbnbs of that size there charge and book on average, from AirROI, a company that publishes Airbnb data town by town. It takes off each cost and gives a rough yearly figure, not a forecast for one unit.</p><div class="st-calc" role="group" aria-labelledby="stCalcT"><p class="t" id="stCalcT">Your rental, before any loan</p><div class="st-pick" role="group" aria-label="Start from a typical condo"><span>Start from a typical condo:</span><button type="button" data-t="garden-city-beach" aria-pressed="true">Garden City Beach</button><button type="button" data-t="surfside-beach" aria-pressed="false">Surfside Beach</button><button type="button" data-t="myrtle-beach" aria-pressed="false">Myrtle Beach oceanfront</button><button type="button" data-t="north-myrtle-beach" aria-pressed="false">North Myrtle Beach oceanfront</button></div><div class="st-pick st-who" role="group" aria-label="Who runs it"><span>Who runs it:</span><button type="button" data-m="0" aria-pressed="true">You</button><button type="button" data-m="15" aria-pressed="false">A manager at 15%</button></div><div class="cols"><div><label for="stTown">Town<select id="stTown"><option value="north-myrtle-beach">North Myrtle Beach</option><option value="myrtle-beach">Myrtle Beach</option><option value="surfside-beach">Surfside Beach</option><option value="garden-city-beach" selected>Garden City Beach</option><option value="murrells-inlet">Murrells Inlet</option><option value="pawleys-island">Pawleys Island</option><option value="little-river">Little River</option><option value="conway">Conway</option></select></label><label for="stBeds">Bedrooms<select id="stBeds"><option value="2" selected>2</option><option value="3">3</option></select></label><p class="st-note" id="stFill" aria-live="polite"></p><label for="stPrice">Price, $<input id="stPrice" type="number" min="0" step="1000" value="343500" inputmode="decimal"></label><label for="stFee">HOA fee a month, $<input id="stFee" type="number" min="0" step="25" value="575" inputmode="decimal"></label><label for="stNightly">Nightly rate, $<input id="stNightly" type="number" min="0" step="1" value="243" inputmode="decimal"></label><label for="stNights">Nights booked a year<input id="stNights" type="number" min="0" step="1" value="95" inputmode="decimal" max="365"></label><div class="row"><span><label for="stTax">Property tax a year, $</label><button type="button" class="q" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="stTaxQ" aria-label="What the property tax means">?</button></span><input id="stTax" type="number" min="0" step="1" value="4272" inputmode="decimal"></div><p class="tip" id="stTaxQ">The county taxes a rental you do not live in on 6 percent of its value, at the tax rate for its address. On the Garden City Beach condo that is about $4,300 a year, about 1.2 percent of the price. The calculator fills it in from the price where we know the rate.</p><label for="stIns">Rental insurance and permit a year, $<input id="stIns" type="number" min="0" step="10" value="620" inputmode="decimal"></label><label for="stMgr">Manager, % of nightly bookings<input id="stMgr" type="number" min="0" step="0.5" value="0" inputmode="decimal" max="100"></label><label class="ck" for="stUtil"><input id="stUtil" type="checkbox"><span>The HOA fee pays the electric and internet</span></label></div><div class="out" aria-live="polite"><div class="ln"><span>Guests pay, with cleaning fees</span><strong id="stGross">$26,843</strong></div><div class="ln"><span>Cleaner, paid by the cleaning fee</span><strong id="stClean">-$3,758</strong></div><div class="ln"><span>Airbnb's fee</span><strong id="stAir">-$3,490</strong></div><div class="ln"><span>Utilities and internet</span><strong id="stUt">-$1,342</strong></div><div class="ln"><span>Supplies and repairs</span><strong id="stSup">-$1,342</strong></div><div class="ln"><span>Manager</span><strong id="stMg">$0</strong></div><div class="ln sum"><span>Kept before the home's bills</span><strong id="stBefore">$16,911</strong></div><div class="ln"><span>HOA fee</span><strong id="stHoa">-$6,900</strong></div><div class="ln"><span>Property tax</span><strong id="stTx">-$4,272</strong></div><div class="ln"><span>Insurance and permit</span><strong id="stIn">-$620</strong></div><div class="big"><span>You keep a year<button type="button" class="q" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="stKeptQ" aria-label="What you keep a year means">?</button></span><strong id="stKept">$5,119</strong></div><p class="tip" id="stKeptQ">The rate and nights are town averages, so one unit can do better or worse. Costs are AirROI's shares for the town, the low end of what owners pay. Your own condo insurance policy is extra, and no loan is counted. Chapter3 does not manage rentals.</p><div class="big"><span>Nights needed to pay the bills</span><strong id="stNeed">66</strong></div><p class="say" id="stSay"></p></div></div></div><script>(function(){var D={"north-myrtle-beach":{"key":"north-myrtle-beach","name":"North Myrtle Beach","clean":15,"run":24,"ins":510,"adr2":246,"n2":72,"adr3":348,"n3":73,"mills":221.2,"price":369900,"fee":1075},"myrtle-beach":{"key":"myrtle-beach","name":"Myrtle Beach","clean":13,"run":24,"ins":390,"adr2":252,"n2":87,"adr3":339,"n3":95,"mills":254.6,"price":327000,"fee":1225},"surfside-beach":{"key":"surfside-beach","name":"Surfside Beach","clean":14,"run":23,"ins":640,"adr2":245,"n2":80,"adr3":315,"n3":92,"mills":201,"price":192000,"fee":375},"garden-city-beach":{"key":"garden-city-beach","name":"Garden City Beach","clean":14,"run":23,"ins":620,"adr2":243,"n2":95,"adr3":352,"n3":95,"mills":207.3,"price":343500,"fee":575},"murrells-inlet":{"key":"murrells-inlet","name":"Murrells Inlet","clean":14,"run":24,"i